{"root":"lelap","ipa":"/lɛ.lap/","core":"指人熟睡、沉睡的状态，也引申为完全、彻底。","pos":["形容词","动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/lɛ.lap/","zh":"熟睡，沉睡","phrases":[{"t":"tidur lelap","zh":"睡得香甜"},{"t":"terlelap","zh":"入睡，睡着"},{"t":"lelap tidur","zh":"沉睡"}],"examples":[{"t":"Anak itu sudah tidur lelap di kamarnya.","zh":"那个孩子已经在房间里睡熟了。"},{"t":"Dia masih lelap meskipun hari sudah siang.","zh":"尽管天已经亮了，他依然睡得很沉。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"lelap","ipa":"/lɛ.lap/","zh":"熟睡的","phrase":{"t":"terlalu lelap","zh":"睡得太死"},"example":{"t":"Saya sangat lelap tadi malam.","zh":"我昨晚睡得很沉。"}},{"w":"terlelap","ipa":"/tər.lɛ.lap/","zh":"入睡","phrase":{"t":"terlelap di sofa","zh":"在沙发上睡着"},"example":{"t":"Dia terlelap saat menonton televisi.","zh":"他在看电视时睡着了。"}},{"w":"melelapkan","ipa":"/mə.lɛ.lap.kan/","zh":"使入睡","phrase":{"t":"melelapkan mata","zh":"闭上眼睛入睡"},"example":{"t":"Musik lembut ini dapat melelapkan anak.","zh":"这首柔和的音乐能让孩子入睡。"}},{"w":"kelelapan","ipa":"/kə.lɛ.lap.an/","zh":"过度睡眠，昏睡","phrase":{"t":"suasana kelelapan","zh":"沉睡的氛围"},"example":{"t":"Kota itu berada dalam kelelapan malam.","zh":"那座城市处于夜晚的沉睡中。"}}],"derSlugs":["lelap","terlelap","melelapkan","kelelapan"],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T17:13:45.607Z","src":"base"}